          0.463,
          0.624,
          0.52
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "• Expanded coverage of new microscope technologies, including superresolution light microscopy and atomic resolution electron microscopy (Chapter 9), and new research breakthroughs from cryo-electron microscopy, such as stretch-activated Piezo channels (Chapter 11)."
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.082,
