          0.598,
          0.624,
          0.642
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "Finally, we are thrilled to offer online assessment, for the first time, with the Digital Problems Book in Smartwork—reimagining the classic companion text, The Problems Book, for twenty-first century instructors and students."
          }
        ],
